  "description": "Double Peak, a series inspired by a local spot not far from Haro, utilizes a low stand-over height and low center of gravity frame made from 6000 series aluminum, featuring an internal head tube and internal cable routing to keep things clean and tucked away. The Sport model features a new Suntour XCT-30 100mm fork with hydraulic lockout, a 24-speed drive train with Shimano RapidFire 3x8-speed shifters. It glides along on alloy double wall rims, stainless spokes and MTB specific 27.5\" x 2.2\" tires. The Sport likes to go fast, but it can stop on a dime thanks to the new Shimano MT-200 Hydraulic disc brake set.\nDouble Peak 6000 Series alloy frame w/ internal routing\nNew Suntour XCT-30 100mm travel fork w/ hydraulic Lockout\nShimano TY-501 42/34/24T crankset\nShimano TY-700 front & Altus rear derailleurs\nShimano HG-200 8-spd 12-32T cassette\nXD-180 alloy DW rims\nShimano SL-M310 RapidFire 3x8-spd shifters\nNew Shimano MT-200 hydraulic brakeset, Center Lock\nNew Shimano TX-505 hubs\n27.5\"x2.2\" XC-type tires",
